# Galaxy Brain coroutine crash handler.
# Discovered by kotlinx.coroutines via ServiceLoader when the agent jar
# is on the classpath and kotlinx-coroutines-core is present at runtime.
#
# This points to a class that must implement
# kotlinx.coroutines.CoroutineExceptionHandler.  Since we cannot compile
# against kotlinx without adding a dependency, the actual handler is a
# thin wrapper that delegates to GbAgent.captureAndWrite().
#
# To use: compile GbCoroutineHandler.kt (a tiny Kotlin file) alongside
# the agent, or leave this file -- if the class is absent the ServiceLoader
# entry is silently ignored.
GbAgent$GbCoroutineHandler
